#: ../../source/tutorials/h2-mc-solvation.rst:2
msgid "H2 MC Solvation"
msgstr "H2 MC 溶剂化"

#: ../../source/tutorials/h2-mc-solvation.rst:4
msgid ""
"Run fixed-mode H2 Monte Carlo solvation with ``q2m3.solvation``. Install the ``catalyst`` and "
"``solvation`` extras first."
msgstr "使用 ``q2m3.solvation`` 运行固定模式 H2 Monte Carlo 溶剂化。先安装 ``catalyst`` 和 ``solvation`` extras。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/h2-mc-solvation.rst:8
msgid "Run The Script"
msgstr "运行脚本"

#: ../../source/tutorials/h2-mc-solvation.rst:14
msgid ""
"The script builds a ``SolvationConfig``, runs ``run_solvation()``, and reports whether the "
"Catalyst IR cache was a hit or miss."
msgstr "脚本构建 ``SolvationConfig``，运行 ``run_solvation()``，并报告 Catalyst IR 缓存是否命中。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/h2-mc-solvation.rst:18
msgid "Configuration Pattern"
msgstr "配置用法"

#: ../../source/tutorials/h2-mc-solvation.rst:54
msgid "Fixed Mode"
msgstr "Fixed 模式"

#: ../../source/tutorials/h2-mc-solvation.rst:56
msgid ""
"``fixed`` mode uses a vacuum QPE Hamiltonian. It adds MM energy terms during the MC loop. Use "
"this example to check Catalyst, JAX, PySCF, and the IR cache together."
msgstr "``fixed`` 模式使用真空 QPE 哈密顿量。它在 MC 循环中添加 MM 能量项。此示例用于检查 Catalyst、JAX、PySCF 和 IR 缓存。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/h2-mc-solvation.rst:60
msgid ""
"The first run can compile Catalyst IR. Later runs can reuse cached IR if the circuit structure is"
" unchanged."
msgstr "首次运行可能编译 Catalyst IR。如果电路结构不变，后续运行可复用缓存的 IR。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/h2-mc-solvation.rst:64
msgid "Output Fields"
msgstr "输出字段"

#: ../../source/tutorials/h2-mc-solvation.rst:66
msgid ""
"The result dictionary includes energy trajectories, acceptance statistics, timing data, circuit "
"metadata, and optional cache statistics. Diagnostics can add result keys. Code that reads results"
" should use ``.get()`` for optional metadata."
msgstr "结果字典包含能量轨迹、接受统计、计时数据、电路元数据和可选缓存统计。诊断可能增加结果键。读取结果的代码应使用 ``.get()`` 获取可选元数据。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/h2-mc-solvation.rst:72
msgid "Memory Notes"
msgstr "内存说明"

#: ../../source/tutorials/h2-mc-solvation.rst:74
msgid ""
"Use H2 fixed mode for the first MC run. H3O+ and dynamic mode increase Hamiltonian term count, "
"circuit size, and Catalyst compile cost. Treat them as diagnostics until the H2 run passes its "
"checks."
msgstr "首次 MC 运行使用 H2 固定模式。H3O+ 和动态模式会增加哈密顿量项数、电路规模和 Catalyst 编译成本。H2 检查通过前，将它们仅用作诊断。"
